OL,3,GNEWSA'Woman offered to pay to get her
OL,4,Ason a job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was so concerned about her son
OL,7,Fbeing left unemployed she offered to
OL,8,Fpay for him to secure a job, a
OL,9,Fapprenticeships provider has said.
OL,11,FKerry Jackson has spoken out as figures
OL,12,Fshow one in eight young people in the
OL,13,FWest Midlands are not in education,
OL,14,Femployment or training for a job (NEET)
OL,15,Fwith more than a million under 25s
OL,16,Facross the country currently fall into
OL,17,Fthe category.
OL,19,FThe government is considering welfare
OL,20,Freform after a report made a number of
OL,21,Frecommendations including incentives
OL,22,Ffor employers who take on apprentices.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
