OL,3,GNEWSA'Woman offered to pay to get her
OL,4,Ason a job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJackson, co-director of WOW Hair
OL,7,FAcademy in Wolverhampton, welcomed the
OL,8,Fproposals and said: "It needs to be
OL,9,Feasier, more attractive for
OL,10,Fbusinesses."
